otics; and SYN-007 for preventing antibiotic associated diarrhea with oral \u00df-lactam antibiotics. The company has a license agreement with Rasayana Therapeutics, Inc. to research, develop, manufacture, and commercialize any product that includes SYN-020, as well as a clinical trial agreement with Washington University School of Medicine in St. Louis to conduct a Phase 1b/2a clinical trial of SYN-004. Theriva Biologics, Inc. is headquartered in Rockville, Maryland."}}